that's wearing
the wet t-Shirt.

1301
01:21:39,800 --> 01:21:42,136
Hey,
could one of you guys
stop quarrelin'

1302
01:21:42,169 --> 01:21:44,739
And tell me
what the hell that is?

1303
01:21:45,439 --> 01:21:48,109
Tell me i'm dreamin'.

1304
01:21:48,142 --> 01:21:51,545
Well, that,
special agent turner,

1305
01:21:51,579 --> 01:21:53,214
Looks to be
our ride home.

1306
01:21:53,247 --> 01:21:55,249
Thank you.

1307
01:21:55,283 --> 01:21:57,018
Really?

1308
01:21:59,553 --> 01:22:01,622
Ok, take her up.

1309
01:22:01,656 --> 01:22:04,358
With pleasure.

1310
01:22:11,766 --> 01:22:15,336
Let's get the hell
out of here.

1311
01:22:15,369 --> 01:22:16,337
Hey.

1312
01:22:16,370 --> 01:22:17,204
Hello.

1313
01:22:17,238 --> 01:22:20,308
Hey! Down here!

1314
01:22:35,389 --> 01:22:37,124
This way.

1315
01:22:37,158 --> 01:22:38,125
Captain.

1316
01:22:38,159 --> 01:22:39,126
Captain?

1317
01:22:39,160 --> 01:22:42,330
Jack shaw, captain,
s.S.N. Roosevelt.

1318
01:22:42,363 --> 01:22:43,164
Move it, casper.

1319
01:22:43,197 --> 01:22:45,132
Boy, are we glad to see you.

1320
01:22:45,166 --> 01:22:46,500
Welcome aboard.

1321
01:22:46,534 --> 01:22:48,035
Move!

1322
01:22:48,069 --> 01:22:49,537
Stay where you are.

1323
01:22:49,570 --> 01:22:51,272
Don't make a sound.

1324
01:22:54,475 --> 01:22:56,610
Don't move.

1325
01:22:56,644 --> 01:22:59,613
Whoo!
Ha ha ha ha!

1326
01:22:59,647 --> 01:23:02,249
Oh, it's good
to have you here, kids.

1327
01:23:02,283 --> 01:23:03,451
I wasn't sure
you'd make it.

1328
01:23:03,484 --> 01:23:05,453
Oh, you got to be
kidding me.

1329
01:23:05,486 --> 01:23:07,588
Roy...

1330
01:23:07,621 --> 01:23:09,724
it seems that my ship
has finally come in.

1331
01:23:09,757 --> 01:23:12,526
It's just a little
bigger than i expected.

1332
01:23:12,560 --> 01:23:16,230
Let's escort our guests
down to the engine room.

1333
01:23:16,263 --> 01:23:18,165
I'm going nowhere.

1334
01:23:18,199 --> 01:23:19,433
Leave him alone.

1335
01:23:19,467 --> 01:23:21,669
Ohh!
Leave her.

1336
01:23:21,702 --> 01:23:23,404
Thank you.

1337
01:23:23,671 --> 01:23:25,740
White bird to chameleon.

1338
01:23:25,773 --> 01:23:29,443
Estimated pickup
in 12 minutes.

1339
01:23:29,877 --> 01:23:34,382
Life's but a walking shadow

1340
01:23:34,415 --> 01:23:35,616
A poor player

1341
01:23:35,649 --> 01:23:40,187
Who frets and struts
his hour upon the stage

1342
01:23:40,221 --> 01:23:42,757
And then is heard
no more.

1343
01:23:42,790 --> 01:23:44,492
It is a tale
told by an idiot--

1344
01:23:44,525 --> 01:23:46,260
Full of sound and fury,

1345
01:23:46,293 --> 01:23:49,397
Signifying nothing.

1346
01:23:55,369 --> 01:23:56,771
Captain...

1347
01:23:56,804 --> 01:23:58,572
there's something
on the radar.

1348
01:23:59,807 --> 01:24:01,375
What is it?
What is it?

1349
01:24:01,409 --> 01:24:03,144
Whatever it is, it's big,

1350
01:24:03,177 --> 01:24:05,413
And it's moving
in our direction.

1351
01:24:05,446 --> 01:24:07,248
Oh, my god.

1352
01:24:07,281 --> 01:24:09,517
It's coming closer.

1353
01:24:09,884 --> 01:24:12,653
Ah, felix,

1354
01:24:12,686 --> 01:24:15,256
Just in time.

1355
01:24:15,289 --> 01:24:18,359
What are you
looking at, shorty?

1356
01:24:18,392 --> 01:24:19,393
Whoa.

1357
01:24:19,427 --> 01:24:21,729
Ick.

1358
01:24:23,631 --> 01:24:25,666
Room service.

1359
01:24:29,270 --> 01:24:30,805
Lovely.

1360
01:24:30,838 --> 01:24:31,806
That's on me, guys.

1361
01:24:31,839 --> 01:24:34,575
The helicopter's due in a few minutes.

1362
01:24:36,210 --> 01:24:39,613
Set the timer
at 14 minutes.

1363
01:24:39,647 --> 01:24:43,184
Mustn't miss
the fireworks.

1364
01:24:44,919 --> 01:24:47,588
Captain, it's coming closer.

1365
01:24:48,355 --> 01:24:50,558
It's coming closer.

1366
01:24:51,325 --> 01:24:54,762
It's heading
straight for us.

1367
01:24:57,431 --> 01:24:59,266
What is it?

1368
01:24:59,300 --> 01:25:00,301
It's going to hit.

1369
01:25:00,334 --> 01:25:01,869
Oh, my god!

1370
01:25:06,974 --> 01:25:09,343
Don't move!
Don't move!

1371
01:25:27,628 --> 01:25:29,330
Keep your hands up!

1372
01:25:29,363 --> 01:25:31,866
Stay down!
Stay down!

1373
01:25:38,272 --> 01:25:40,174
Watch out!

1374
01:25:42,309 --> 01:25:43,444
No!

1375
01:25:43,477 --> 01:25:44,278
No!

1376
01:26:01,762 --> 01:26:03,864
Let me guess.

1377
01:26:04,632 --> 01:26:06,233
Big...

1378
01:26:06,267 --> 01:26:07,468
slimy...

1379
01:26:07,501 --> 01:26:08,702
about 8 arms.

1380
01:26:08,736 --> 01:26:11,372
Don't you just love him?

1381
01:26:11,405 --> 01:26:12,806
Mmm.

1382
01:26:12,840 --> 01:26:14,475
Aah!

1383
01:26:19,480 --> 01:26:20,614
Out of the way!

1384
01:26:20,648 --> 01:26:23,484
Out of the way!
Move!

1385
01:26:50,978 --> 01:26:53,347
Aah! Aah!

1386
01:26:53,380 --> 01:26:54,882
Aah! Aah!

1387
01:26:54,915 --> 01:26:57,585
Aah! Aah!

1388
01:26:57,618 --> 01:27:01,021
Aah!

1389
01:27:01,055 --> 01:27:03,524
Aah!

1390
01:27:04,692 --> 01:27:05,859
Oscar...

1391
01:27:05,893 --> 01:27:06,794
kill them.

1392
01:27:06,827 --> 01:27:08,362
I'll be on the deck.

1393
01:27:08,395 --> 01:27:09,430
My pleasure.

1394
01:27:09,463 --> 01:27:11,398
Felix.

1395
01:27:17,338 --> 01:27:19,406
Time to die.

1396
01:27:19,440 --> 01:27:20,674
You first.

1397
01:27:20,708 --> 01:27:21,709
Oscar?

1398
01:27:21,742 --> 01:27:23,510
Huh?

1399
01:27:26,547 --> 01:27:28,749
Ohh!

1400
01:27:30,484 --> 01:27:31,585
Unh!

1401
01:27:31,619 --> 01:27:33,387
Oh, no.

1402
01:27:34,788 --> 01:27:37,791
Oh, that's not good.

1403
01:27:37,825 --> 01:27:38,826
Thank you.

1404
01:27:38,859 --> 01:27:40,361
Anytime.

1405
01:27:41,395 --> 01:27:42,463
Unh!

1406
01:27:42,496 --> 01:27:43,364
Aah!

1407
01:27:43,397 --> 01:27:45,733
I think it's broken.

1408
01:27:45,766 --> 01:27:47,401
Take it easy.

1409
01:27:47,434 --> 01:27:48,669
This should help.

1410
01:27:48,702 --> 01:27:49,970
You're so good to me.

1411
01:27:50,004 --> 01:27:50,971
I know.
Hey, guys.

1412
01:27:51,005 --> 01:27:53,474
We got to get
out of here.

1413
01:27:53,507 --> 01:27:55,109
What about casper?

1414
01:27:55,142 --> 01:27:56,510
What about the bomb?

1415
01:27:56,543 --> 01:27:58,679
We got about 6 minutes.

1416
01:27:58,712 --> 01:28:01,415
You go get casper.

1417
01:28:01,448 --> 01:28:02,683
I'll dismantle the bomb.

1418
01:28:02,716 --> 01:28:04,752
Great.

1419
01:28:07,721 --> 01:28:09,890
Disarm the bomb?

1420
01:28:09,923 --> 01:28:12,026
I'm with him.

1421
01:28:13,527 --> 01:28:15,129
Yeah, i thought so.

1422
01:28:35,182 --> 01:28:37,451
Get out of the way!

1423
01:28:37,484 --> 01:28:39,119
Out of the way!

1424
01:28:42,723 --> 01:28:44,425
Come on!
Come on!

1425
01:28:47,127 --> 01:28:49,663
Casper!

1426
01:28:52,166 --> 01:28:54,535
Get down!

1427
01:28:55,069 --> 01:28:56,170
Now!

1428
01:28:56,203 --> 01:28:57,404
Roy...

1429
01:28:57,438 --> 01:29:00,974
parting
is such sweet sorrow.

1430
01:29:01,008 --> 01:29:02,710
I mean it!

1431
01:29:02,743 --> 01:29:03,343
Look, it's over!

1432
01:29:03,377 --> 01:29:05,946
This time,
i'll shoot!

1433
01:29:05,979 --> 01:29:07,081
Roy!

1434
01:29:07,114 --> 01:29:09,783
Look out!
Aah!

1435
01:29:17,091 --> 01:29:19,526
Room service.

1436
01:29:29,236 --> 01:29:30,504
Don't make me do this!

1437
01:29:30,537 --> 01:29:32,172
No. Not again, roy.

1438
01:29:32,206 --> 01:29:33,841
This is disappointing.

1439
01:29:33,874 --> 01:29:35,709
What a boring way
to end this

1440
01:29:35,743 --> 01:29:37,144
After all
we've been through--

1441
01:29:37,177 --> 01:29:41,048
You with a gun in your hand
which you can't fire

1442
01:29:41,081 --> 01:29:43,183
And me riding off
into the sunset.

1443
01:29:43,217 --> 01:29:44,685
Come on, turner.

1444
01:29:44,718 --> 01:29:46,553
Bon voyage, roy!

1445
01:29:50,824 --> 01:29:53,694
Oh, come on.
Shoot him.

1446
01:29:55,095 --> 01:29:57,798
Not in cold blood.
I can't.

1447
01:30:01,502 --> 01:30:03,470
I win, roy!

1448
01:30:03,804 --> 01:30:06,707
I win!
Ha ha ha!

1449
01:30:09,676 --> 01:30:11,545
Oh, god.

1450
01:30:11,578 --> 01:30:13,714
Ha ha!

1451
01:30:17,551 --> 01:30:20,254
Not in
this lifetime,

1452
01:30:20,287 --> 01:30:22,089
Old chap!

1453
01:31:01,695 --> 01:31:02,329
The bomb!

1454
01:31:02,362 --> 01:31:05,532
Come on, come on,
come on!

1455
01:31:11,138 --> 01:31:13,273
Hey, how'd you do?

1456
01:31:13,307 --> 01:31:14,141
How'd
you
do?

1457
01:31:14,174 --> 01:31:18,111
Well, as the expression
goes, he's dead.

1458
01:31:18,645 --> 01:31:19,613
You took him out?

1459
01:31:19,646 --> 01:31:20,547
I didn't have to.

1460
01:31:20,581 --> 01:31:21,748
Seems even our friend

1461
01:31:21,782 --> 01:31:23,617
Knows a bad guy
when he sees one.

1462
01:31:23,650 --> 01:31:25,085
Look, i couldn't
shut it off,

1463
01:31:25,118 --> 01:31:26,620
But maybe we can dump it
over the side.

1464
01:31:26,653 --> 01:31:27,955
It'll save the ship,
at least.

1465
01:31:27,988 --> 01:31:29,256
Well, if there's
anything left to save.

1466
01:31:29,289 --> 01:31:30,858
I mean, the creature's
ripped it half apart,

1467
01:31:30,891 --> 01:31:31,725
And it's coming back
for more.

1468
01:31:31,758 --> 01:31:34,027
All right, then,
why don't we just, uh,

1469
01:31:34,061 --> 01:31:35,829
Shove it down
the damn thing's
throat?

1470
01:31:35,863 --> 01:31:36,997
Shaw, this is serious.

1471
01:31:37,030 --> 01:31:38,232
Actually, he's got a point.
What have we got to lose?

1472
01:31:38,265 --> 01:31:41,568
I mean, if we get
one more chance
to blow this thing up...

1473
01:31:41,602 --> 01:31:43,670
the submersible.
Look, just get me to it.

1474
01:31:43,704 --> 01:31:44,738
I'll handle it
from there.

1475
01:31:44,771 --> 01:31:45,606
No way, shaw.
Turner!

1476
01:31:45,639 --> 01:31:48,809
Look, don't you
take this away from me.

1477
01:31:54,781 --> 01:31:56,850
Huh?

1478
01:32:05,826 --> 01:32:06,793
All right.

1479
01:32:06,827 --> 01:32:09,029
You got 3 minutes,

1480
01:32:09,062 --> 01:32:11,131
50 seconds.

1481
01:32:15,002 --> 01:32:15,802
Here.

1482
01:32:15,836 --> 01:32:18,071
My bronze star--

1483
01:32:18,105 --> 01:32:20,173
For luck...

1484
01:32:20,641 --> 01:32:23,911
special agent turner.

1485
01:32:25,279 --> 01:32:30,217
You know,
i've heard about the kind
of luck you have, shaw,

1486
01:32:30,250 --> 01:32:32,319
But, um...

1487
01:32:33,253 --> 01:32:35,956
thanks.
I know that this...

1488
01:32:35,989 --> 01:32:37,724
this means a lot to you,

1489
01:32:37,758 --> 01:32:38,792
And, uh--

1490
01:32:38,825 --> 01:32:39,693
Guys, come on.

1491
01:32:39,726 --> 01:32:42,296
You're getting me
all teary-Eyed here.

1492
01:32:42,329 --> 01:32:47,634
Go on. Get the hell
out of here.

1493
01:32:49,269 --> 01:32:52,072
Ok. Go on. Go.

1494
01:32:53,941 --> 01:32:56,276
I'll see you
on the other side.

1495
01:32:57,110 --> 01:32:59,346
Why'd he say that?

1496
01:32:59,379 --> 01:33:00,380
Ohh.

1497
01:33:05,085 --> 01:33:07,287
How much time
does he have?

1498
01:33:07,321 --> 01:33:09,356
Don't ask.

1499
01:33:10,424 --> 01:33:11,592
Where the hell is he?

1500
01:33:11,625 --> 01:33:14,294
He's gone fishing.
Where the hell
do you think he is?

1501
01:33:14,328 --> 01:33:17,698
Oh, christ, i hope
he makes it back
in one piece.

1502
01:33:17,731 --> 01:33:20,400
Yeah, me, too.
He's got my star.

1503
01:33:20,434 --> 01:33:23,370
What? You know,
you are so...

1504
01:33:23,403 --> 01:33:25,305
uhh!
Aah!

1505
01:33:28,075 --> 01:33:29,376
Ok.

1506
01:33:29,409 --> 01:33:30,711
Plenty of time.

1507
01:33:30,744 --> 01:33:32,312
Don't panic.
Just...

1508
01:33:40,253 --> 01:33:43,056
i don't see him anywhere.

1509
01:33:43,090 --> 01:33:44,825
There!
What's that?

1510
01:33:46,727 --> 01:33:49,162
Nothing.
Nothing.

1511
01:33:49,429 --> 01:33:52,099
Come on, roy, come on!

1512
01:33:52,132 --> 01:33:55,035
24 seconds. No problem.

1513
01:33:55,068 --> 01:33:56,136
All right.

1514
01:33:56,169 --> 01:33:59,272
Ok. It's just like
driving a car--

1515
01:34:00,407 --> 01:34:02,409
Underwater.

1516
01:34:02,442 --> 01:34:04,277
Ok. Ok.

1517
01:34:04,311 --> 01:34:05,412
I'll tell you--

1518
01:34:05,445 --> 01:34:09,216
If he pulls this off,
he can keep
the damn star.

1519
01:34:09,249 --> 01:34:11,118
Right.

1520
01:34:11,451 --> 01:34:13,153
But, darling,

1521
01:34:13,186 --> 01:34:17,024
I'm certainly not
giving up on you yet.

1522
01:34:18,992 --> 01:34:21,061
Oh, my god.

1523
01:34:21,828 --> 01:34:23,697
Oh, my god.

1524
01:34:30,337 --> 01:34:31,271
Come on.

1525
01:34:31,304 --> 01:34:33,740
Let's go, brother.
Come on!

1526
01:34:38,879 --> 01:34:40,747
You want to eat this?

1527
01:34:40,781 --> 01:34:44,384
Let's go!
Let's go! Come on!

1528
01:35:16,516 --> 01:35:17,784
Where is he?

1529
01:35:17,818 --> 01:35:19,886
I don't see him!

1530
01:35:19,920 --> 01:35:21,455
Oh, god.

1531
01:35:21,488 --> 01:35:22,422
Do you see him?

1532
01:35:22,456 --> 01:35:25,225
Do you see him
anywhere?

1533
01:35:29,830 --> 01:35:30,363
Roy!

1534
01:35:30,397 --> 01:35:32,065
Hey, did you see that?

1535
01:35:32,099 --> 01:35:34,000
Hey!
Hey, buddy!

1536
01:35:34,034 --> 01:35:35,235
Hey!

1537
01:35:35,268 --> 01:35:36,803
We did it!

1538
01:35:37,204 --> 01:35:38,572
We did it!

1539
01:35:38,605 --> 01:35:41,274
We did it!

1540
01:35:42,542 --> 01:35:44,311
Whoo!

